  - Super Administrator – full system access.  
  - Company Administrator – manages institution-level settings.  
  - Principal – oversees school operations.  
  - Teacher – manages classes, assessments, communication.  
  - Parent/Guardian – access learner progress.  
  - Learner – access personal academic records.  

